&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights &amp;amp; Recommendations:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver clear, data-driven insights on growth, margin, risk, and ROI to inform executive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled FP&amp;amp;S:&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI tools to improve planning speed, analysis quality, reporting workflows, and decision support.&lt;/li&gt;
