&lt;li&gt;Inform buy vs build decisions, supporting broad business strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand customer, partner, and product team needs, and represent your teams in technical conversations with company leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
