&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Adoption &amp;amp; Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify underutilization and remove barriers to deeper embedding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface expansion opportunities tied to customer workflows and risk exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales on renewals and strategic growth motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for retention and expansion revenue across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use advanced AI tools to build systems that help us grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Product Into Business Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
