&lt;li&gt;Lead quarterly business reviews that demonstrate ROI and strategic value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn performance data into actionable insights that influence customer strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI to turn data into insights&lt;/li&gt;
