&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will shape how Customer Success operates in a new business line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with sophisticated customers solving complex trust &amp;amp; safety problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have real commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
