&lt;p&gt;The Integrations team at Checkr builds and maintains the pre-built integrations that plug Checkr&#39;s background check platform directly into the HR tech stacks of our customers. With 200+ integrations across the industry&#39;s top ATS, HRIS, and payroll platforms, including Workday, iCIMS, SAP SuccessFactors, and many others, the team eliminates redundancies across platforms and enables a seamless screening workflow for recruiters and candidates alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on the Integrations team, you&#39;ll drive the technical architecture of complex, multi-system workflows, spanning OAuth flows, webhook event processing, data mapping, and partner-facing APIs. You&#39;ll set the technical bar for how Checkr&#39;s platform connects to the broader HR landscape, enabling faster hiring and a better experience for both employers and candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
